<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Hewlett-Packard Co shares were up two at 51-1/2 in London following the after-hours release of the company's first quarter results. Earnings per share were $0.87, compared to a First Call estimate of $0.75.</p>
<p>* Harnischfeger Industries Inc reported first quarter earnings per share of $0.65, up from $0.50 a year ago but below the First Call estimate of $0.67. The stock closed at 44-3/4 Tuesday.  </p>
<p>* Cognizant Corp reported fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.58, up from $0.46 a year ago and a First Call estimate of $0.55. The stock closed at 34-1/4.</p>
